{"id": "EUVD-2026-101933", "enisaUuid": "f78e4824-d520-34df-b047-622ef3692bcd", "description": "In Eclipse Vert.x versions [4.0.0, 4.5.34] or [5.0.0,5.0.12] or [5.1.0,5.1.9] or [5.2.0, 5.2.0], the uniqueItems keyword validation uses an O(n\u00b2) pairwise comparison loop with no short-circuit or size limit. A remote unauthenticated attacker can submit a moderately-sized JSON array that consumes disproportionate CPU time, leading to denial of service.\n\n\n\nThe impacted component is io.vertx:vertx-json-schema.\n\n\n\nThe following Vert.x modules depend on vertx-json-schema and are also affected:\n\n\n\nio.vertx:vertx-web-openapi-router io.vertx:vertx-web-validation io.vertx:vertx-openapi", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T08:23:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:40:19", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/eclipse-vertx/vertx-json-schema/security/advisories/GHSA-4m87-8qfr-8p8m", "https://gitlab.eclipse.org/security/cve-assignment/-/work_items/340"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-102461", "GHSA-5ww7-gp4j-grqp"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4a9bb0ac-a235-3cd4-8648-2ed2965489f1", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Vert.x", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 \u22645.0.12"}, {"id": "5e8d2e89-5af8-3b32-9aab-e4ffac3a6685", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Vert.x", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "5.1.0 \u22645.1.9"}, {"id": "980a4e57-c0ac-3357-a9b9-b1c931b650e2", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Vert.x", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "5.2.0"}, {"id": "d73c457c-a4b8-3a26-b331-fb2b456e671c", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Vert.x", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 \u22644.5.34"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e00b9241-0414-3a0f-ac41-7dc02f7b84ac", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}